  "modules": [
    {
      "id": "uniequip_001_utage",
      "name": {
        "en": "Utage's Badge",
        "zh": "宴证章",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "INITIAL",
      "typeName2": "",
      "icon": "uniequip_001_utage",
      "description": {
        "en": "Operator Utage has demonstrated a remarkable aptitude for solo confrontation with the enemy while far removed from support lines.\nThe Field Operations Department has thus passed the following resolution:\nThis operator shall be appointed a Guard Operator during field operations to exercise Musha responsibilities.\nIn witness whereof,\nThis badge is hereby conferred upon the above named.",
        "zh": "干员宴擅长远离支援独自面对敌人\n根据外勤部门决议\n在外勤任务中划分为近卫干员，行使武者职责\n特别颁发此证章\n以兹证明",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "servers": [
        "cn",
        "global"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "uniequip_002_utage",
      "name": {
        "en": "Flip Phone",
        "zh": "翻盖手机",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
      "type": "ADVANCED",
      "typeName2": "X",
      "icon": "uniequip_002_utage",
      "description": {
        "en": "[♥ Case Lily Nail Salon] Dear customers, our new location is now open! We've imported a state-of-the-art Colombian nail printer. Come give it a try! Make an appointment so you won't have to wait. Mwah~!\n[Bank Alert] Your bank card payment failed due to insufficient funds.\n[♥ Case Lily Nail Salon] Dear customer, your appointment on March 22nd was cancelled because we didn't receive your deposit. Please book with us again. Mwah~!\n[Lungmen Report] This week's Munchventure takes us to a donburi restaurant located in the shopping district. The taste-to-price ratio is through the roof, so the place is always packed. Whew, look at that tender, juicy meat. Gulp it up and feel your troubles wash away.\nOur adventurers paint a picture of the restaurant's owner, one Mr. Matsumoto, as a young, successful, and overall admirable entrepreneur. When we asked about his plans for the future, the shy young man blushed and told us he was ready to give up being single and hoped to enjoy a café date with his special someone. We wish him well.\n[Large Hot Coffee] Autumn is coming, enjoy a cup of coffee with it. Your 'drink voucher' is about to expire. You'll want to come get your voucher set ASAP!\n[Large Hot Coffee] Your autumn latte is done and your delivery is on the way to Case Lily Nail Salon.\n[Eat Your Heart Out] Wow, you'll never guess who I saw today at the donburi restaurant. The woman who owns the nail salon! It turns out she's been in every day lately! Wasn't she trying to lose weight?!\n[Flowers For Love] The bouquet you ordered has been delivered to the donburi restaurant at 1455 Busy Street, and received by the owner. At your service, delivering Flowers For Love♬.\n[Beauty Makeover] Guess who I saw today while getting my nails done. Matsumoto from the donburi restaurant! He even brought coffee for the boss! They must be an item!\n[Lungmen Report] This week, we visit the donburi restaurant in the shopping district again. Their new menu incorporates all kinds of cuteness for the ladies. Check out that pink heart on top, it's too adorable to eat!\n[♥ Case Lily Nail Salon] Dear customers, the owner of our salon recently got engaged. In celebration, we have discounts on various styles, and you can enjoy even deeper discounts by booking in advance. Come give us a try, new friends and old. Mwah~!",
        "zh": "【♥凯丝莉莉美甲店】尊敬的客户您好，本店新开张，引入最新哥伦比亚美甲机器，欢迎前来体验，提前预约，不用等待，啾咪♡！\n【银行短讯】您好，您的银行卡因卡内余额不足，扣款失败。\n【♥凯丝莉莉美甲店】尊敬的客户您好，您于03月22日预约，定金未到账，预约已取消，欢迎下次预定哦，啾咪♡！\n【龙门快报】本周小吃探店，我们来到了一家位于商业街的丼饭店。因为有着超高的性价比，来此就餐的客人络绎不绝。呜——瞧这爽滑弹牙的肉片，让你的烦恼一扫而空。\n据探店先锋的采访，店主松本先生年纪轻轻，就事业有成，非常令人羡慕。当我们问起他目前的计划时，这个腼腆的年轻人红着脸告诉我们，他想要摆脱单身，和恋人一起去咖啡店约会。让我们祝愿他早日找到自己的恋人。\n【大杯咖啡】嗨，秋意浓浓，来杯咖啡，您有一张“饮品兑换券”即将过期，快点进券包使用吧！\n【大杯咖啡】您的秋意拿铁已经制作完毕，外送人员正骑车前往凯丝莉莉美甲店。\n【吃吃吃吃不停】呜哇哇，你知道今天我在丼饭店看到谁了吗？是美甲店的老板娘！问起来才知道她这几天每天都有来！她不是为了瘦身在节食吗？！\n【爱意涌动鲜花】顾客您好，您订购的花束已送至商业街1455号丼饭店，店主已查收。爱意涌动，为您服务♬\n【美美美要变美】你猜我今天做美甲的时候看到谁了。丼饭店的松本先生！他还给老板娘带了咖啡！他们两个绝对绝对有问题！！\n【龙门快报】本周我们再次来到了位于商业街的丼饭店，这里推出的新品融入了女孩子喜欢的可爱元素，看这盖在上面的粉色桃心，呜，真是让人舍不得吃呢！\n【♥凯丝莉莉美甲店】尊敬的客户您好，店主近日订婚，店内多种款式均有折扣，提前预约更享折上折，欢迎新老客户前来体验，啾咪♡！",
        "isMachineTranslation": false
      },
